#     See android/app/src/llm/README.md and android/app/src/voicegate/README.md.
*.task
*.litertlm
*.onnx
*.onnx_data
*.gguf
*.safetensors
/models/
/android/models/

# --- Ad-hoc screenshots (the CV test fixtures used by debug_*.py ARE kept) ---
baro_check*.png
dash_check*.png

